trName":"灭火先锋","strDescription":"祖传尿遁绝技！","strImage":"https://shared.steamstatic.com/community_assets/images/apps/1338580/a509abb98f9a2b660448541f45c76a10a81529bc.jpg","bAchieved":false,"rtUnlocked":0,"flAchieved":72.80000305175781,"flMinProgress":0,"flCurrentProgress":0,"flMaxProgress":0},{"strID":"planefall_dude","strName":"用兄弟打败兄弟！","strDescription":"兄弟，我兄弟呢？","strImage":"https://shared.steamstatic.com/community_assets/images/apps/1338580/a509abb98f9a2b660448541f45c76a10a81529bc.jpg","bAchieved":false,"rtUnlocked":0,"flAchieved":64.30000305175781,"flMinProgress":0,"flCurrentProgress":0,"flMaxProgress":0},{"strID":"win","strName":"世界得救了！","strDescription":"好耶！","strImage":"https://shared.steamstatic.com/community_assets/images/apps/1338580/a509abb98f9a2b660448541f45c76a10a81529bc.jpg","bAchieved":false,"rtUnlocked":0,"flAchieved":63.099998474121094,"flMinProgress":0,"flCurrentProgress":0,"flMaxProgress":0},{"strID":"bonfire_branch","strName":"个小就是好！","strDescription":"太小也不好！","strImage":"https://shared.steamstatic.com/community_assets/images/apps/1338580/a509abb98f9a2b660448541f45c76a10a81529bc.jpg","bAchieved":false,"rtUnlocked":0,"flAchieved":51.70000076293945,"flMinProgress":0,"flCurrentProgress":0,"flMaxProgress":0},{"strID":"space_asteroids","strName":"小行星，撞地球。","strDescription":"这玩意儿还挺上头。","strImage":"https://shared.steamstatic.com/community_assets/images/apps/1338580/a509abb98f9a2b660448541f45c76a10a81529bc.jpg","bAchieved":false,"rtUnlocked":0,"flAchieved":36.400001525878906,"flMinProgress":0,"flCurrentProgress":0,"flMaxProgress":0},{"strID":"cga_vapour","strName":"CGA波","strDescription":"老就是新！","strImage":"https://shared.steamstatic.com/community_assets/images/apps/1338580/a509abb98f9a2b660448541f45c76a10a81529bc.jpg","bAchieved":false,"rtUnlocked":0,"flAchieved":35.20000076293945,"flMinProgress":0,"flCurrentProgress":0,"flMaxProgress":0},{"strID":"boy_lost","strName":"死胡同！","strDescription":"哈哈！","strImage":"https://shared.steamstatic.com/community_assets/images/apps/1338580/a509abb98f9a2b660448541f45c76a10a81529bc.jpg","bAchieved":false,"rtUnlocked":0,"flAchieved":33.29999923706055,"flMinProgress":0,"flCurrentProgress":0,"flMaxProgress":0},{"strID":"64_hump","strName":"这就叫做爱！","strDescription":"小炸弹能有什么坏心思呢？","strImage":"https://shared.steamstatic.com/community_assets/images/apps/1338580/a509abb98f9a2b660448541f45c76a10a81529bc.jpg","bAchieved":false,"rtUnlocked":0,"flAchieved":33,"flMinProgress":0,"flCurrentProgress":0,"flMaxProgress":0},{"strID":"grass_fly","strName":"你惊扰了它！","strDescription":"你个畜生！","strImage":"https://shared.steamstatic.com/community_assets/images/apps/1338580/a509abb98f9a2b660448541f45c76a10a81529bc.jpg","bAchieved":false,"rtUnlocked":0,"flAchieved":32.20000076293945,"flMinProgress":0,"flCurrentProgress":0,"flMaxProgress":0},{"strID":"95_trash","strName":"核废品回收站！","strDescription":"这东西真的能回收吗？","strImage":"https://shared.steamstatic.com/community_assets/images/apps/1338580/a509abb98f9a2b660448541f45c76a10a81529bc.jpg","bAchieved":false,"rtUnlocked":0,"flAchieved":32.099998474121094,"flMinProgress":0,"flCurrentProgress":0,"flMaxProgress":0}],"vecAchievedHidden":[],"nTotal":93,"nAchieved":0}}],["associations",{"version":2,"data":{"rgDevelopers":[{"strName":"Sos Sosowski","strURL":null}],"rgPublishers":[{"strName":"Devolver Digital","strURL":"https://store.steampowered.com/publisher/DevolverDigital"}],"rgFranchises":[{"strName":"McPixel","strURL":"https://store.steampowered.com/curator/42581086"},{"strName":"Devolver Digital","strURL":"https://store.steampowered.com/franchise/DevolverDigital"}]}}],["descriptions",{"version":1,"data":{"strFullDescription":"那是只鸟？是架飞机？掉得那么快，肯定猜得都不对。原来是像素哥！一个总会陷入你想都想不到的难以置信的困境的半吊子英雄！\r\n\r\n[h2]关卡[/h2]\r\n你一会困在疾驶向悬崖的列车中，一会又置身于坠落的飞机上。你有时得赢下一场毫无胜算的足球赛，有时是只想躲避陨石袭击的恐龙。困在着火的房子里？还是被夹在交战的两方军队中？这当然对像素哥都不成问题！100个快节奏的动作关卡等你来挑战！\r\n\r\n[imgvid poster.avif=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1338580/extras/8d68ed50e72cc42936d1fd8d64b21d7d.poster.avif?t=1688543116\" webm=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1338580/extras/8d68ed50e72cc42936d1fd8d64b21d7d.webm?t=1688543116\" width=\"800\" height=\"76\"][/imgvid]\r\n\r\n[h2]小游戏[/h2]\r\n寻常的冒险风格有时会有结合多元素的小游戏的点缀。游戏类型有竞速、射击、战斗和体育，甚至还有平台动作或第一人称射击！游戏提供了超过20个分散在《像素哥》世界各地的小游戏！\r\n\r\n[imgvid poster.avif=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1338580/extras/d2d967a68c2639d3be94204b5742bb74.poster.avif?t=1688543116\" webm=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1338580/extras/d2d967a68c2639d3be94204b5742bb74.webm?t=1688543116\" width=\"800\" height=\"76\"][/imgvid]\r\n\r\n[h2]金币与印章[/h2]\r\n《像素哥》的重点并不只是在拯救世界，而是尝试想出可能最疯狂的解决方案并乐在其中。每想出解决方案便能获得金币！找出关卡内的所有解决方案，获得金级奖和额外金币！你可以用金币解锁新关卡！人人都爱金币，对吧？金光闪闪又转来转去！金币永远不嫌多的！\r\n\r\n[imgvid poster.avif=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1338580/extras/2c5995728ee077d0c0823511a4fc4b2a.poster.avif?t=1688543116\" webm=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1338580/extras/2c5995728ee077d0c0823511a4fc4b2a.webm?t=1688543116\" width=\"800\" height=\"76\"][/imgvid]\r\n\r\n[h2]McBurg[/h2]\r\n游戏故事发生在McBurg市。探索城市并尝试各种冒险！城市中的部分道路被封锁了，需要花费金币才能前进到新关卡！在游玩过程中，城市中会出现你去过的关卡的角色和物品。你也可以穿着在游玩时发现的部分服装。\r\n\r\n你可以在城市边陲的一座长满青草的小山上，看到隐约出现在McBurg上空满是黄金的Devolver穹顶。因此你如果需要很多金币，也许是时候去拜访下Fork Parker了？\r\n\r\n[imgvid poster.avif=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1338580/extras/afb565bada8060287607f18d911df163.poster.avif?t=1688543116\" webm=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1338580/extras/afb565bada8060287607f18d911df163.webm?t=1688543116\" width=\"800\" height=\"76\"][/imgvid]\r\n\r\n[h2]史蒂夫[/h2]\r\n你有时会在冒险中遇到史蒂夫。史提夫会出现在各种怪异和意想不到的地方，找到他会将你传送到史蒂夫关卡。\r\n\r\n史蒂夫并不像像素哥，也不擅长拯救世界。他就是一普通……人，在做他自己的事。比如钓鱼、烹饪、开车或召唤恶魔。你知道的，就是些普通人会做的事。\r\n\r\n[imgvid poster.avif=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1338580/extras/834e9c2a11469e08ed1c2aea86a12a14.poster.avif?t=1688543116\" webm=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1338580/extras/834e9c2a11469e08ed1c2aea86a12a14.webm?t=1688543116\" width=\"800\" height=\"76\"][/imgvid]\r\n\r\n[h2]像素哥引擎[/h2]\r\n《像素哥 3》是在100%软件渲染的像素哥引擎上执行，所以在这个显卡昂贵的年代也绝对能够顺畅执行！\r\n\r\n该引擎是为了运行《像素哥》而量身打造的。这使得游戏即使在老旧的计算机上也能顺畅执行，所以你下次去探望阿嬷时，一定要在她的计算机上安装《像素哥》！除此此外，这也让游戏更环保！《像素哥 3》会拯救地球（和电池寿命）！\r\n\r\n[h2]主要特色[/h2]\r\n[list][*]100个出人意料的关卡\r\n[*]超过1000个令人捧腹的笑话\r\n[*]近1500个可互动物品\r\n[*]超过20个各类小游戏\r\n[*]300,000,000个像素点\r\n[*]在你老妈的古早电脑上也能玩\r\n[*]史蒂夫\r\n[*]一个全是水的关卡[/list]","strSnippet":"《像素哥三代（McPixel 3）》是一款让你大开眼界的拯救世界游戏，游戏中你要操作半吊子主角一次次通过既无厘头又滑稽的非常规方法避免一场场灾难。"}}]]